      - ``"raw"``: return lapack-internal representations of shape ``(..., M, N)`` and ``(..., K)``.
      - ``"r"``: return `R` only.

  Returns:
    A tuple ``(Q, R)`` (if ``mode`` is not ``"r"``) otherwise an array ``R``,
